# Nothing here is imported by the app; these only run from a developer's
# machine. Keeping them out of the upload also keeps the 4 MB paper catalogue
# CSV out of every deployment.
#
# Every pattern MUST be anchored with a leading slash. These are gitignore
# semantics: a bare `supabase/` matches at any depth and would also delete
# `lib/supabase/`, which is runtime code.
/brand/
/data/
/scripts/
/supabase/
/tests/
/FEATURES.md
